{2}│{R}  {5}Locked containers are always skipped, with{R}       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}a warning. If every requested container is{R}       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}locked (nothing gets upgraded), the command{R}      {2}│{R}
